 "content_notes": "Tone: absurd and ironic. No weapon is drawn or pointed and no violence is shown; the soldiers hold only torches. The smugglers were never identified: they appear only as anonymous dark silhouettes (no face, ethnicity or costume). The National Guard troops, the soldiers, the border agent and the young man in the lesson are generic figures, never named; no badge, flag, patch, crest or insignia of any real force or army; no agency logo. The marijuana is shown only as plain taped bundles and sealed cans. The camera frame in the hook is our own generic graphic, not real footage. The seized quantity is reported as 45 lb by NBC, Reuters and CSM and 35 lb by AP/CBS; the screen says so. Every card is our own typed graphic. No dialogue is invented. Status verified 2026-10-16.",
